  "description": "Lisney Sothebys International Realty are delighted to present this two-bedroom apartment to rent in Cherbury Court. No. 6 has its own door, is a ground floor apartment, in this well-established development just off Booterstown Avenue. Set in a quiet and secure position, No. 6 enjoys a private setting while remaining exceptionally convenient to a wide range of local amenities. The accommodation is well laid out and includes a living/dining room, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms & bathroom. Cherbury Court is a mature red-brick development built in the 1970s & set within landscaped grounds and offering a peaceful residential environment. The location is particularly strong. UCD Belfield and St. Vincents Hospital are within easy reach, as are shopping and dining options in Blackrock Village, Frascati, and Blackrock Shopping Centre. Blackrock Park and Stillorgan Village are also close by, while the nearby Quality Bus Corridor and Booterstown DART provide excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond. Motorway access is equally convenient via the N11 and M50. Several well-established and sought-after schools, such as Blackrock College, St Andrews College, St Michaels College, Colaiste Eoin, and Mount Anville, are also close by, adding to the locations strong appeal. This apartment represents a rare opportunity to live in a bright, well-proportioned home in a quiet and established development with excellent access to transport & local amenities. Lease available immediately. Viewing highly recomended.",
